# MIME types for the CMS-uploaded engraving fonts (see
# App\Service\Personalization\PersonalizationFontUploader). Set explicitly
# rather than relying on the host's mime.types being current: an older Apache
# serves .woff2 as application/octet-stream, which some browsers refuse to
# accept as a font. Harmless where the host already knows these types.
#
# Nothing else is needed here: every file in this folder is written by the
# uploader under a server-generated name with a verified font extension, so
# there is nothing else to serve.
AddType font/woff2 .woff2
AddType font/woff .woff
AddType font/ttf .ttf
AddType font/otf .otf
